WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.383 --> 00:00:17.645
place scares me," the Tang Monk said.

2
00:00:18.986 --> 00:00:21.428
He and his companions were traveling through a dense forest.

3
00:00:22.909 --> 00:00:24.551
Vines hung from twisted branches.

4
00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:28.194
The leaves up above blocked out the sunlight.

5
00:00:28.914 --> 00:00:30.776
The whole place was dark and spooky.

6
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.681
Wukong waved a hand.

7
00:00:34.521 --> 00:00:36.282
"You worry too much, Master!

8
00:00:37.323 --> 00:00:38.884
Nothing here is going to harm you."

9
00:00:38.904 --> 00:00:41.525
"That's right!"

10
00:00:42.886 --> 00:00:44.227
Bajie puffed his chest.

11
00:00:45.187 --> 00:00:47.229
"You have us, and—Ouch!

12
00:00:47.549 --> 00:00:48.369
A bug bit me!"

13
00:00:50.951 --> 00:00:53.152
Bajie swung his rake as the bug flew away.

14
00:00:59.035 --> 00:00:59.556
shook his head.

15
00:01:00.604 --> 00:01:02.485
"I don't think you worry too much, Master.

16
00:01:03.606 --> 00:01:05.908
There have been many dangers along the way.

17
00:01:07.189 --> 00:01:08.409
But we'll keep you safe."

18
00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:11.031
Wukong yawned.

19
00:01:11.051 --> 00:01:14.954
"Yes, we'll protect you, Master."

20
00:01:16.695 --> 00:01:18.236
The Tang Monk gave him a funny look.

21
00:01:18.256 --> 00:01:21.918
"Wukong, didn't you get enough sleep last night?"

22
00:01:21.938 --> 00:01:25.521
"I got enough sleep," Wukong said.

23
00:01:25.541 --> 00:01:27.762
"I'm just bored."

24
00:01:27.782 --> 00:01:30.164
"How can you be bored?"

25
00:01:30.540 --> 00:01:31.420
Wujing asked.

26
00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:35.382
"We just saved Master from a demon yesterday!"

27
00:01:38.243 --> 00:01:39.164
Wukong shrugged.

28
00:01:39.184 --> 00:01:40.924
"That was yesterday.

29
00:01:41.985 --> 00:01:43.405
Today is boring so far.

30
00:01:44.806 --> 00:01:47.107
And besides, that demon yesterday was dumb.

31
00:01:48.147 --> 00:01:49.828
Fighting him wasn't a real challenge."

32
00:01:52.289 --> 00:01:54.090
Bajie grabbed an apple from a branch.

33
00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:57.831
"I happen to like when things are boring."

34
00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:05.582
As everyone laughed, a tree shook gently.

35
00:02:07.183 --> 00:02:09.905
Leaves rustled as several figures hurried along a branch.

36
00:02:11.186 --> 00:02:13.748
Suddenly three small chipmunk demons leaped down.

37
00:02:13.768 --> 00:02:15.789
"The Tang Monk!"

38
00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:17.130
one demon said.

39
00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.432
Bajie and Wujing drew their weapons.

40
00:02:21.553 --> 00:02:24.095
The Tang Monk shook with fear and fell from his horse.

41
00:02:26.116 --> 00:02:27.057
Wukong chuckled.

42
00:02:28.958 --> 00:02:31.100
"Relax, Master."

43
00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.161
He took out his iron bar, which quickly grew.

44
00:02:34.181 --> 00:02:37.222
"I'll take care of these silly little demons."

45
00:02:38.802 --> 00:02:41.503
One of the demons raised his head, trying to look tall.

46
00:02:41.523 --> 00:02:43.943
"You're not afraid of us?"

47
00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:46.364
Wukong snorted.

48
00:02:50.865 --> 00:02:55.987
tiny!" "Then why do you need that huge iron bar?"

49
00:02:56.407 --> 00:02:57.307
another demon asked.

50
00:02:57.327 --> 00:03:00.088
"Yeah!" the third demon said.

51
00:03:00.768 --> 00:03:05.452
"If you truly weren't afraid of us, you wouldn't need such a big weapon."

52
00:03:09.274 --> 00:03:09.615
know what?

53
00:03:09.675 --> 00:03:10.155
You're right!"

54
00:03:11.296 --> 00:03:12.977
Wukong put the iron bar away.

55
00:03:12.997 --> 00:03:16.439
"In fact, let's make this even more fun.

56
00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:19.762
I'll fight you blindfolded too!"

57
00:03:21.003 --> 00:03:24.045
He took out a cloth and tied it around his head, covering his eyes.

58
00:03:25.486 --> 00:03:27.928
One of the chipmunk demons quickly whispered something.

59
00:03:29.244 --> 00:03:30.425
As he did, a tree moved.

60
00:03:32.045 --> 00:03:35.667
Its branches reached out and grabbed the Tang Monk, Bajie, and Wujing.

61
00:03:37.047 --> 00:03:38.908
Bajie's rake was yanked from his hand.

62
00:03:38.928 --> 00:03:46.431
"Hey—" Bajie tried to cry out, but a branch quickly stuffed leaves into his mouth.

63
00:03:47.632 --> 00:03:50.233
More leaves muffled the voices of the Tang Monk and Wujing.

64
00:03:51.394 --> 00:03:53.134
Another branch grabbed Wujing's spear.

65
00:03:54.155 --> 00:03:56.676
The chipmunk demons chuckled and jumped onto a branch.

66
00:03:57.824 --> 00:04:01.026
Light sparkled, and the tree vanished, along with everyone in it.

67
00:04:01.046 --> 00:04:05.569
"I was wrong, Master," Wukong said.

68
00:04:05.589 --> 00:04:07.810
"Today isn't boring at all!"

69
00:04:08.971 --> 00:04:10.551
He turned toward where the demons had been.

70
00:04:10.571 --> 00:04:13.073
"Are you all ready to fight me?"

71
00:04:14.794 --> 00:04:16.595
A light breeze blew through the forest.

72
00:04:20.157 --> 00:04:21.498
Wukong scratched his head.

73
00:04:21.518 --> 00:04:25.200
"Hello?" Then he laughed.

74
00:04:27.272 --> 00:04:28.854
"They got scared and ran off!

75
00:04:29.935 --> 00:04:30.596
See, Master?

76
00:04:30.876 --> 00:04:36.203
You never have to worry when I'm around Master?"

77
00:04:36.223 --> 00:04:37.785
Wukong ripped off the blindfold.

78
00:04:37.805 --> 00:04:38.986
"Oh no!

79
00:04:39.427 --> 00:04:41.630
What happened to my friends—Oof!"

80
00:04:42.571 --> 00:04:46.195
Two more figures appeared out of nowhere and knocked Wukong to the ground.
